  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>(도입)</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:23.1pt;text-indent:-10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">숨을 쉬어보세요</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:23.1pt;text-indent:-10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">한 손은 가슴에</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">한 손은 배에 올립니다</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">가슴을 움직이지 않고 숨을 쉬어보세요</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:23.1pt;text-indent:-10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">배도 움직이지 말고 숨을 쉬어보세요</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:23.1pt;text-indent:-10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4. </span><span style=\"font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;\">가슴이나 배를 움직이지 않으면 숨을 쉴 수 없습니다</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:23.1pt;text-indent:-10.0pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:맑은 고딕;font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-ascii-font-family:맑은 고딕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:-0.7pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 0.6em; text-indent: -10pt; letter-spacing: -0.7pt;\">(전개)</p><p><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">1. 폐 모형 &amp; 폐 그림  보고 폐모형을 실제와 비교하며 폐 특징 찾기(5가지)</span></p><p><span style=\"text-align: center; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: Arial; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; word-spacing: 0px; float: none; display: inline !important; white-space: pre-wrap; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">2. 폐 해부는 시범으로 <br>3.심장-폐 차이 찾아 적기(5가지)</span></p><p><br></p></div><p><iframe id=\"v8687b5Q0OZQp0K0IQQIQIr\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v8687b5Q0OZQp0K0IQQIQIr?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY4Njg3YjVRME9aUXAwSzBJUVFJUUlyIiwidGlkIjoiN2M1MTZhZWYtZmQwZS00ZjY3LTg5NmQtNmJmOGM1YjRmODk3IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZ